        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is just a bit of decluttering. Probably.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Clean Break</i> is a short first-person narrative game about objects, memories, and the quiet violence of letting go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a seemingly ordinary home. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break furniture that doesn’t belong. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the house begins to change, so does your understanding of what you’re <i>really</i> breaking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal 20 minute journey through grief, memory, and emotional cleanup. </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is just a bit of decluttering. Probably.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Clean Break</i> is a short first-person narrative game about objects, memories, and the quiet violence of letting go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a seemingly ordinary home. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break furniture that doesn’t belong. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the house begins to change, so does your understanding of what you’re <i>really</i> breaking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal 20 minute journey through grief, memory, and emotional cleanup. </p>",
